ent-ComputerAnalysisConsole = 分析主控台 | analysis console
    .desc = 一台用於與神器分析儀進行介面連接的電腦。 | A computer used to interface with the artifact analyzer.
ent-ComputerId = ID卡電腦 | ID card computer
