ent-computerBodyScanner = 人體掃描儀電腦 | body scanner computer
    .desc = 一台人體掃描儀。 | A body scanner.
ent-ComputerComms = 通訊電腦 | communications computer
    .desc = 這台電腦用來透過鍵盤發布全站廣播、設定適當的警報等級，以及呼叫緊急穿梭機。 | A computer used to make station wide announcements via keyboard, set the appropriate alert level, and call the emergency shuttle.
ent-SyndicateComputerComms = 辛迪加通訊電腦 | syndicate communications computer
