ent-CentcommComputerComms = 中央指揮通訊電腦 | central command communications computer
    .desc = 一種透過鍵盤向全球發布公告的電腦。它是普通通訊電腦的「高級版」。 | A computer used to make world wide announcements via keyboard. The superior cousin of the regular communications computer.
ent-ComputerSolarControl = 太陽能控制電腦 | solar control computer
