ent-ComputerRadar = 質量掃描電腦 | mass scanner computer
    .desc = 一台用於偵測附近物體，並根據其位置與質量進行顯示的電腦。 | A computer for detecting nearby bodies, displaying them by position and mass.
ent-ComputerCargoOrders = 貨運請求電腦 | cargo request computer
