ent-ComputerCargoOrdersMedical = 醫療申請電腦 | medical request computer
    .desc = 由醫療部門用於訂購物資。 | Used by the medical department to order supplies.
ent-ComputerCargoOrdersScience = 科學請求電腦 | science request computer
    .desc = 由科學系用於訂購用品。 | Used by the science department to order supplies.
ent-ComputerCargoOrdersSecurity = 安全請求電腦 | security request computer
    .desc = 由安全部門用於訂購物資。 | Used by the security department to order supplies.
ent-ComputerCargoOrdersService = 服務請求電腦 | service request computer
    .desc = 由服務部門用於訂購耗材。 | Used by the service department to order supplies.
ent-ComputerCargoBounty = 貨運懸賞電腦 | cargo bounty computer
