ent-ComputerCloningConsole = 複製主機電腦 | cloning console computer
    .desc = 這是克隆系統的核心部件，也是醫學界最偉大的成就。它擁有許多連接埠和電線。 | The centerpiece of the cloning system, medicine's greatest accomplishment. It has lots of ports and wires.
ent-ComputerSalvageJobBoard = 打撈工作佈告欄 | salvage job board
    .desc = 若你夠硬派，這便是用來存取打撈任務的主控台。 | Console for accessing salvage jobs, if you're tough enough.
ent-ComputerSalvageExpedition = 打撈遠征電腦 | salvage expeditions computer
    .desc = 若你夠硬派，這裡曾接受過打撈任務。 | Used to accept salvage missions, if you're tough enough.
ent-ComputerSurveillanceCameraMonitor = 攝影機螢幕 | camera monitor
    .desc = 一台監視器螢幕。你正在監視他們。也許吧。 | A surveillance camera monitor. You're watching them. Maybe.
ent-ComputerSurveillanceWirelessCameraMonitor = 無線攝影機監控螢幕 | wireless camera monitor
    .desc = 一台無線監控攝影機的螢幕。你正在監視他們。也許吧。 | A wireless surveillance camera monitor. You're watching them. Maybe.
ent-ComputerSurveillanceWirelessXenoborgCameraMonitor = xenoborg 攝影機螢幕 | xenoborg camera monitor
    .desc = 一款無線異種生化人攝影機螢幕。你正在監視他們。也許吧。 | A wireless xenoborg camera monitor. You're watching them. Maybe.
ent-ComputerPalletConsole = 貨運銷售電腦 | cargo sale computer
