ent-ComputerXenoborgsControl = 異種博格控制台 | xenoborgs control console
    .desc = 用於遠端監控所有異種機器人。 | Used to remotely monitor all xenoborgs.
ent-StationAiUploadComputer = AI 上傳控制台 | AI upload console
    .desc = 用於更新太空站人工智慧的運作法則。 | Used to update the laws of the station AI.
ent-StationAiFixerComputer = AI 修復控制台 | AI restoration console
    .desc = 用於修復受損的人工智慧。 | Used to repair damaged artifical intelligences.
ent-ComputerNukieDelivery = 辛迪加配送電腦 | syndicate delivery computer
    .desc = 一款能為特定核能運作設備進行「藍空間」操作的電腦。 
        該電路板已整合至機架中，若拆解則無法回收。 | A computer that can bluespace in certain equipment for Nuclear Operations. 
        The circuitboard is integrated into the frame and can't be recovered if deconstructed.
